KPL/PCK

\begindata

NAIF_BODY_NAME += ( 'PPT-LT-CHAIN-CA' )
NAIF_BODY_CODE += ( -1030 )

\begintext

Custom spacecraft name registration for the
PARTHENOPE -> PSYCHE -> THEMIS LT-chain trajectory.
After furnishing this file alongside PPT_LT_CHAIN_trajectory.bsp,
you can use either the name "PPT-LT-CHAIN-CA" or the integer ID
-1030 when calling spkezr / spkpos / etc.
